---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Signup from '../components/Signup.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Denvil Lee — ten years in law enforcement, twelve in ministry, a ThM from Fuller, and a long interest in what it means that the kingdom has already started.">
  <section class="ab">
    <div class="wrap ab__grid">
      <div class="ab__intro">
        <p class="label">About</p>
        <h1 class="ab__h">I came to ministry the long way around.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="prose ab__body">
        <p>
          For ten years I carried a badge. For twelve I have carried a text. Both
          jobs put you in rooms on the worst day of somebody's life, and both
          teach you the same thing from opposite directions: people are rarely
          helped by abstractions.
        </p>
        <p>
          I hold a ThM from Fuller Theological Seminary. I have served as a campus
          pastor, a teaching pastor, a young adults pastor, a residency director,
          and a leadership formation pastor. My wife Krista and I have three
          children, and we recently moved the family to South Florida.
        </p>
        <h2>Why "Now and Not Yet"</h2>
        <p>
          It is the assumption underneath the whole New Testament and almost
          nobody says it out loud. The age to come broke into this one at the
          resurrection and has not finished arriving. That is why the same week
          can hold a healing and a funeral without either one being a mistake.
        </p>
        <p>
          Everything on this site is written from inside that overlap. It is not a
          mood. It is an address.
        </p>
        <h2>A note on what this is not</h2>
        <p>
          This is a personal site. It is not published on behalf of any church,
          it carries no church's branding, and nothing here should be read as an
          official statement from anywhere I serve.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="ab__side">
        <div class="fact">
          <h2 class="label">At a glance</h2>
          <dl class="facts">
            <div><dt>Education</dt><dd>ThM, Fuller Theological Seminary</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Earlier</dt><dd>Ten years in law enforcement</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Since</dt><dd>Twelve years in pastoral ministry</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Home</dt><dd>South Florida</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <a class="btn btn--primary fact__cta" href="/speaking/">Invite me to teach</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Signup tone="plain" />
</Base>
<style>
  .ab { padding-block: clamp(2.8rem, 2.2rem + 3vw, 5rem) clamp(3rem, 2.5rem + 3vw, 5.5rem); }
  .ab__grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 4rem); grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 20rem); align-items: start; }
  .ab__intro { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .ab__h { font-size: var(--step-4); margin-top: 1rem; max-width: 18ch; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .ab__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .ab__side { position: sticky; top: 92px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .ab__side { position: static; } }
  .fact { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--ground-raised); padding: 1.4rem; }
  .facts { margin-top: 1.2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .facts dt { font-size: var(--step--2); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .facts dd { margin: 0; font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
  .fact__cta { margin-top: 1.5rem; width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
</style>
